// Tidewall: floating islands over a sunset harbor. Hand-written; `cargo xtask art` copies it to
// assets/gen with each variant's size and mask hash filled in.
//
// Spawns are columns, mirrored about the middle (x = 900) so neither side starts with the better
// ground: four on the west islands, four on the east. `cargo xtask art` refuses any spawn that
// leaves a mobile hanging off an edge or under an overhang.
MapInfo(
    name: "tidewall",
    title: "Tidewall",
    variants: [
        (id: "A", spawns: [130, 330, 575, 800, 1000, 1225, 1470, 1670]),
    ],
)
